1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,930
Fourteen pools, a lazy river, a water slide, and the water park is free for hotel guests.

2
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:10,895
That is The Royal at Atlantis, in the Bahamas.

3
00:00:10,945 --> 00:00:15,645
If you want a vacation where the water is everywhere, I picked this one for you.

4
00:00:15,695 --> 00:00:19,450
In the next two minutes, I'll show you how to get the most out of it.

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,665
Start with the water.

6
00:00:20,715 --> 00:00:27,040
Fourteen outdoor pools, plus a children's pool, a lazy river, and a private beach.

7
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:34,280
Aquaventure, the big water park, is a three-minute walk away, and Expedia lists free water park access for guests.

8
00:00:34,330 --> 00:00:40,390
So the plan is simple: pool in the morning, slides in the afternoon, beach at sunset.

9
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,340
Here is the part I love most.

10
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:48,915
Steps from the hotel is The Dig, described as the world's largest open-air marine habitat.

11
00:00:48,965 --> 00:00:52,890
You can walk past real sea life, right on the resort.

12
00:00:52,940 --> 00:00:57,570
And if you like the water, the resort lists snorkeling and volleyball too.

13
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:58,640
Now, dinner.

14
00:00:58,690 --> 00:01:03,785
The resort lists twenty restaurants on site, and six beach bars.

15
00:01:03,835 --> 00:01:09,400
Photos show the Moon Bar, a sushi spread, and a terrace right by the water.

16
00:01:09,450 --> 00:01:14,150
With this many choices, you could eat somewhere new every night of the week.

17
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:17,005
When the sun goes down, the resort keeps going.

18
00:01:17,055 --> 00:01:23,720
The Atlantis casino is a short walk, there is a nightclub on site, and a marina full of yachts to stroll past.

19
00:01:23,770 --> 00:01:25,320
Prefer something calm?

20
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:31,110
There is the Mandara Spa, yoga and Pilates classes, and a golf course on the property.

21
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:31,930
Your room.

22
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:38,040
The Royal has one thousand two hundred and one rooms, remodeled in twenty twenty-four, and many photos show ocean views.

23
00:01:38,090 --> 00:01:42,190
A few things worth knowing, so you can plan.

24
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:46,960
Check-in starts at four in the afternoon, and the minimum check-in age is eighteen.

25
00:01:47,010 --> 00:01:51,815
The buffet breakfast, valet parking, and airport shuttle all cost extra.

26
00:01:51,865 --> 00:01:55,920
And the airport is about twenty-three to thirty minutes away by car.

27
00:01:55,970 --> 00:01:57,750
So, is it worth it?

28
00:01:57,800 --> 00:02:02,590
Guests rate it eight point eight out of ten, from over three thousand reviews.

29
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:09,545
My honest score: nine out of ten, for travelers who want the water, the food, and the nightlife in one place.

30
00:02:09,595 --> 00:02:12,620
Book it with the link in the description.
